[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFAA00]1. Installation & Requirements[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Java Runtime:[/B] Java 21 or higher.
[*][B]Server Platform:[/B] Spigot, Paper, Purpur, or Folia supporting Minecraft 1.21.11 to 26.3.
[*][B]Optional Dependency:[/B] [URL='https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/placeholderapi.6245/']PlaceholderAPI[/URL].
[/LIST]

[B]Installation Steps:[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download [FONT=Courier New]ChatGames-1.0.0.jar[/FONT] and place it inside your server's [FONT=Courier New]plugins/[/FONT] directory.
[*]Restart your server to generate [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT], [FONT=Courier New]lang.yml[/FONT], [FONT=Courier New]content.yml[/FONT], [FONT=Courier New]challenges.yml[/FONT], and [FONT=Courier New]prizes.yml[/FONT].
[*]Customize your settings and run [FONT=Courier New]/cg reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFAA00]2. Permissions Reference[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Permission Node[/TH]
[TH]Default[/TH]
[TH]Description[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.*[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]op[/TD]
[TD]Grants full administrative and player access.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.admin[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]op[/TD]
[TD]Grants access to start, stop, score management, scheduler, history, and reload.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.user[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]true[/TD]
[TD]Default player access to participate, view rankings, and toggle preferences.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.participate[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]true[/TD]
[TD]Allows viewing and participating in active rounds.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.help[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]true[/TD]
[TD]Allows viewing [FONT=Courier New]/cg help[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.leaderboard[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]true[/TD]
[TD]Allows viewing [FONT=Courier New]/cg top[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.fastest[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]true[/TD]
[TD]Allows viewing [FONT=Courier New]/cg fastest[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.score[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]true[/TD]
[TD]Allows checking personal score via [FONT=Courier New]/cg score[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.score.manage[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]op[/TD]
[TD]Allows modifying or resetting player scores.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.visibility[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]true[/TD]
[TD]Allows toggling chat broadcasts via [FONT=Courier New]/cg visibility[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.audio[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]true[/TD]
[TD]Allows toggling sound alerts via [FONT=Courier New]/cg audio[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.start.*[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]op[/TD]
[TD]Allows launching any puzzle or challenge round.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.stop[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]op[/TD]
[TD]Allows cancelling an active round via [FONT=Courier New]/cg stop[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.scheduler[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]op[/TD]
[TD]Allows toggling the automated scheduler via [FONT=Courier New]/cg scheduler[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.history[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]op[/TD]
[TD]Allows inspecting audit history via [FONT=Courier New]/cg history[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]chatgames.command.reload[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]op[/TD]
[TD]Allows reloading configuration files via [FONT=Courier New]/cg reload[/FONT].[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]

